Subject: [PATCH 16/30] ARM: OMAP3: 3430SDP: Adapt to ehci-omap changes
Date: Mon, 28 Jan 2013 13:30:17 +0200
Message-ID: <1359372631-8180-17-git-send-email-rogerq@ti.com>
